<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="1" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear&quot;,sans-serif">The KPI
associated with your employee’s approved Deal Win Goal (DWG) is no longer
achieved.&nbsp; <a href="{!Core_Goal__c.Link}">Click HERE</a> to review the DWG
and associated Opportunity.</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">AR:</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp; </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">Please review your DWG and determine if
action should be taken (e.g. recalled, cancelled).</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">If the DWG remains in "No KPI
Achieved" status, you will be contacted during the next Commissions Audit
cycle.</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><b style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif;">Deal Win Goal Name:</span></b><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif;">&nbsp;{!Core_Goal__c.Name}</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial;"><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif;">Deal Win Goal Owner:&nbsp;</span></b><font face="Intel Clear, sans-serif">{!Core_Goal__c.Core_Goal_Owner__c}</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><b><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif;">Category:&nbsp;</span></b><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif;">{!Core_Goal__c.Core_Goal_Category__c}</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><b><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif;">KPI Name:&nbsp;</span></b><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif;">{!Core_Goal__c.Core_Goal_BU_Focus_Area__c}<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><b style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear&quot;,sans-serif">Opportunity Name:&nbsp;</span></b><font style="" face="Arial, sans-serif"><o:p></o:p>{!Core_Goal__c.Core_Opportunity__c}</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt;">















</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">Guidance
on common triggers and associated mitigation for DWGs that no longer have a
‘KPI Achieved’ status, see below.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:.5in"><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear&quot;,sans-serif">Trigger
#1:&nbsp; The associated opportunity was
reversed (approval revoked) in order to add a missing team member.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:.5in"><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Mitigation:&nbsp; Opportunity Owner should add the additional
team member(s) and resubmit the Opportunity for review.&nbsp; Ideally the ‘resubmit and managerial
review/approval’ cycle should be completed as quickly as possible (~5 business
days) to avoid Commissions audit follow up.&nbsp;&nbsp;
Once the approval is complete, the DWG will become achieved again and no
further action is required.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:.5in"><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear&quot;,sans-serif">Trigger
#2:&nbsp;&nbsp; Additional product(s) have been
added to an opportunity where the existing products that achieved the same KPI
had already been approved.&nbsp;&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:.5in"><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Mitigation:&nbsp;&nbsp; Manager must recall the DWG approval (this
must be done for each email notification received) and then the Opportunity or
Technical Owner must submit the new products on the opportunity for
approval.&nbsp; Once these additional products
are approved, and the KPI on the DWG matches, the DWG can be resubmitted.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:.5in"><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear&quot;,sans-serif">Trigger
#3:&nbsp;&nbsp; Changes to any of the opportunity
fields that are used to execute the KPIs (including but not limited to Solution
Area, Product Segment, etc.).&nbsp;&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:.5in"><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Mitigation:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Please refer to the KPI Execution Tables
(on the SalesKPI.intel.com site) to validate if the opportunity still meets the
KPI criteria.&nbsp;&nbsp; If it does not, you can
confirm what changed by checking out the ‘Approval &amp; History’ tab on the
opportunity and scrolling down to ‘Opportunity Field History’.&nbsp;&nbsp; This will also identify who made the change
and when.&nbsp;&nbsp; If the change was made in
error, it should be corrected.&nbsp; If the
change is correct, then the DWG approval should be recalled.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:.5in"><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear&quot;,sans-serif"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear&quot;,sans-serif">If you
have additional questions, please log an Ask A Question (AAQ), select the
‘Sales CRM’ topic, and attach this email along with your inquiry for the most
efficient resolution.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; If you have any
questions regarding Commission implications, please use AAQ and select the ‘Ask
Commissions’ topic.&nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></p>

<p style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">_______________________________________________________________________<o:p></o:p></span></p>

